<title>HONG KONG: C. Lyonnais sets warrants on basket of HK hotels.</title>
<headline>C. Lyonnais sets warrants on basket of HK hotels.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it launched on Wednesday 80 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong-listed hotel sector stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Hong Kong and Shanghai Hotels Ltd	  1 share</p>
<p>Regal Hotels International Holdings Ltd  4 shares</p>
<p> Shangri-La Asia Ltd			    1 share</p>
<p> Sino Hotels (Holdings) Ltd		   1 share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$31.365	 PREMIUM	  9.52 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.9048	 GEARING	  4.08x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     30.OCT.97	 PAYDATE	  18.OCT.96</p>
<p>LISTING	  HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   20.OCT.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT   20,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE HK$36.90</p>
<p>NOTES: GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
